  <div class="prose-content">
    <h2 class="section-title">The Tokenisation Question</h2>
    <p>Organisations are exploring tokenisation — representing real-world assets on a distributed ledger — without a clear view of what is technically possible, legally permissible, or operationally viable. The enthusiasm for the technology often outpaces the diligence required to assess whether it is the right approach for a given use case.</p>
    <p>Our approach is thorough and honest. We assess the asset class, the regulatory framework in your jurisdiction, the technical architecture options, and the operational model for issuance, custody, and lifecycle management. The outcome is a feasibility assessment, a regulatory analysis, an architecture recommendation, and an implementation roadmap.</p>
    <p>If the honest answer is not to proceed, we say so. Saving you from a misdirected investment is as valuable a result as enabling a well-founded one.</p>
  </div>

    </div></section>

